  "prompt": "Deliver an analyst-ready Workspace solution for earnings and estimates. The workspace must cover revision rows whose symbol cell syncs the app. The workspace must cover EPS beat and miss history. Analysts need to inspect symbol, revision percentage. An analyst can filter the analysis by ticker. A selection in one part of the analysis stays linked to related results. Leave the complete working workspace open for review. Use `symbol` and `revision_pct` as the only fixed contract anchors, and make the other implementation choices yourself without collateral changes.",
